WEBVTT

00:01:13.068 --> 00:01:13.412
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Hey!

00:01:16.589 --> 00:01:17.344
What are you doing?

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:45.427
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> What’s wrong with you?

00:01:45.786 --> 00:01:48.390
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Look, I made a mistake, OK?

00:01:49.302 --> 00:01:50.875
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I’m so embarrassed.

00:01:52.026 --> 00:01:53.661
Couldn’t you see it was a work photo?

00:01:53.995 --> 00:01:56.568
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I said I’m sorry, OK!

00:01:57.911 --> 00:02:01.078
But it’s always a work ‘something’ with you these days.

00:02:02.094 --> 00:02:03.224
Is that all you think about?

00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:04.605
Your wonderful job?

00:02:06.156 --> 00:02:06.672
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> What?

00:02:08.063 --> 00:02:09.579
Are you annoyed that I’m successful?

00:02:10.276 --> 00:02:11.984
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> No, of course not.

00:02:12.182 --> 00:02:15.460
I’m very proud of you, but…

00:02:18.460 --> 00:02:20.080
but there’s never any time for us.

00:02:23.479 --> 00:02:25.047
And what’s going on with Max?

00:02:29.198 --> 00:02:29.870
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Max?

00:02:31.448 --> 00:02:32.797
Oh, come on, Ben.

00:02:33.656 --> 00:02:35.265
Now you are acting like a child.

00:02:39.854 --> 00:02:41.052
Max is my boss.

00:02:44.385 --> 00:02:45.416
I work with him.

00:02:46.885 --> 00:02:47.911
I work for him.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:56.979
There’s nothing going on…Do you really think I would do that to you?

00:03:01.219 --> 00:03:01.745
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I don’t know.

00:03:05.594 --> 00:03:07.453
I feel like I don’t know who you are anymore.

00:03:11.068 --> 00:03:11.843
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> That’s not fair.

00:03:14.094 --> 00:03:14.641
I’m me.

00:03:15.563 --> 00:03:16.141
I’m Izzy.

00:03:18.974 --> 00:03:21.354
If you don’t like who I am, then I…

00:03:23.302 --> 00:03:23.740
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Then what?

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:29.166
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I can’t have this conversation with you right now.

00:03:34.578 --> 00:03:36.526
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I’m not following you, if that’s what you want.